# Generated data and run artefacts. None of this is source, all of it is
# reproducible from the code, and some of it embeds records from third-party
# databases whose licences forbid redistribution (PROTAC-DB is internal-use
# only; UbiBrowser ships as derived counts; BioLiP2 annotations are not
# redistributed). Keeping the whole tree out is simpler and safer than
# redacting individual fields.
campaigns/
data/msa/
data/cache/
data/interim/
data/manifests/
data/nobble.duckdb
data/throughput.json
data/tier_b_selection.parquet
data/tier_b_selection.provenance.json
logs/

